{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1000_p", "source_sha256": "850feb7975dffcd75525103bbdf28552c4d018b1f3268951aa7643972040fb90", "ja": "（今日のミーティングは、次の定期公演についてだ。\n今回は、律子に新曲を歌ってもらおうと思っている）", "zh": "（今天的会议内容是下一场定期公演。这次，我打算让律子唱一首新歌。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "eb29b258dbd381f5c05a8702b3d1dbb90c93d0e20d18a4e49635a60ece0bcb65", "ja": "ほら、音楽のサブスクって、\nお勧めの曲を流してくれたりするでしょ？", "zh": "你看，音乐订阅服务不是会播放推荐歌曲什么的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "1e79303df0a9f0b81d20bba65da6fb00a0d1155ac7681c36b5505fdfe83ae5a9", "ja": "そんな感じで、楽曲の雰囲気を細かく分析して、\nライブのセトリを作ってくれるAIなのよ。", "zh": "就是类似那样，能详细分析歌曲的氛围，帮忙制作演唱会歌单的AI。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "1a34edad43d1d0e7b037ea870029c75d23ba72ddd5525e3e2557ea0af4459e4d", "ja": "へ～、セトリまで！\nめっちゃ助かるやんな？", "zh": "哦～连演出歌单都能做出来！真是帮大忙了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "72f31716c6c855b8c561263c195838381706a0a0eeb0d6f5017617d00bde0e60", "ja": "{$P$}さんのお仕事が、\nすこしは楽になるかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生的工作，\n说不定也能稍微轻松一点了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1005_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1006_p", "source_sha256": "161170c780f3debd8985985e33a8abba1df82d2b93d9902d8a9455116caaceca", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！\nお、3人ともそろってるな！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n哦，3人全都到齐了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "3e34fd6251ddd62dba4227f413d823748fec78a2f6f4db289f1de50c353a3249", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n可憐とあずささんも、お疲れさまです～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n可怜和梓姐也辛苦了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "d6b832ebf451fc8da728ff048406a716fa129b21425b687a5d6968b21241d98a", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさまです。律子さんの\n楽しそうな声が聞こえてきたけど、何かあったの？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。刚才听到了律子开心的声音，是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "9c959cfc0d8f63334460413c79268a54f8a6e375f6d5dbce99917c68ca4de0e9", "ja": "た、たしか、AI……？が、どうとかって……。", "zh": "好、好像是在说什么AI……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "26a23cb04bf75c70ad5c370d705848989e527f042fc54efd4f237a5e993cf313", "ja": "ええ、オススメのAIアプリを紹介してたの！\nちなみにこれは、セトリを作ってくれるアプリよ。", "zh": "嗯，她介绍了一个推荐的AI应用！顺便说一下，这是款能帮忙制作演出曲目单的应用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "064e916e92a4deb0380528de7b33bad4176a0f8337cb67c2aeee63ca109ac45d", "ja": "セトリを作ってくれる……？", "zh": "能帮忙制作演出歌单……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "35a83887290372d18679ce94e0de0e3bdb6e77a6a8eab0bdbb9894f2d784f709", "ja": "アプリ……え、AIが、ですか……？", "zh": "应用……诶，AI来做吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1013_p", "source_sha256": "99ceff7b198e06f444b08968277f138192f89a39e481ed86df021ff3bfc756fd", "ja": "なるほど、AI……。\n最近すごく流行ってるもんな。", "zh": "原来如此，AI……。\n最近确实很流行嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "a696be6b32443d00ecc1f79da935064cad8b25645d96d03470fb27895a38665c", "ja": "はい。ちなみにこのアプリ、楽曲検索機能も\nあるんですけど、ただ検索できるだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "是的。顺便一提，这个应用还有歌曲搜索功能，不过不只是能搜索而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "21f218426830b68723267048b83dfa632d69eb452d08cf46622f8a1eaf09a849", "ja": "曲を聴かせるだけで、曲名とアーティスト名を\n教えてくれる優れものなんです！", "zh": "只要让它听一段曲子，就能告诉你曲名和艺术家名——真是个厉害的功能！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "c78ca66df202d8c7c988f0c97e256aee91cdd66c7c2b8406fe7aea49043fa7f4", "ja": "曲を聞かせるだけで？　それって、AIがいろんな曲を\n覚えてる……ってことやんな？　ホンマ賢いわ～。", "zh": "只要让它听曲子就行？那就是说，AI记住了各种各样的曲子……对吧？真的好厉害哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "4f73fd0590c85e6e88c30c25d85d5aa425fa8b6cfff5b653a937cc37f7920afe", "ja": "与えればすぐに吸収する……。学習能力の高さは、\n子豚ちゃん達にも負けていませんね～。", "zh": "只要给它信息，它就会马上吸收……学习能力之强，可是一点都不输给小猪们呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "c534d9c44d45adca235d3c814f47599ea798bf72410bc7033b3b3af8e0e451b4", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ……AIって、すごいんですね……。\n私はそういうのに、う、疎くって……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……AI真厉害呢……我、我对这方面不太了解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "dd5ae3b108f1a4c799e35816bac21f4ccf8e0465192bfc292e6a4d4f31cdbefd", "ja": "私もよ、可憐ちゃん。お話を聞いてもさっぱり……。\n律子さんはさすがですね～。", "zh": "我也是，可怜。听你们说了半天，我还是完全不明白……不愧是律子呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "da75abd18674681fcfb946162a8b654fe1c74a8aa574ef88f4281413632880ab", "ja": "私はもともと、ガジェット好きですからね！\nAI、使ってみるとけっこう便利なんですよ。", "zh": "我本来就喜欢各种小工具！AI用起来还挺方便的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "d960ff42f447f94f2d1cd7dbd31cf1be2f7dd69bb97249b888d8370a231de893", "ja": "{$P$}も、\n興味があればレクチャーしますからね！", "zh": "如果{$P$}也感兴趣，我可以教你哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "b11740fb13d7b39a78b0d099b864d9b5cd5ac33d7238a1c3999644a403f6754c", "ja": "仕事の効率化も、捗るかもしれませんし。", "zh": "说不定也能提高工作效率呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e2f157374814d2e7d7931e5af32466757d854e5c1a84fb27b56d14614872d837", "ja": "そうだな……うーん……。", "zh": "是啊……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "b291cef121a52b0ac305f3893b3bf1a660a73ac22bf41715036387264e64cd3b", "ja": "あら？　{$P$}が\n興味を示さないなんて、意外ですね？", "zh": "哎呀？{$P$}居然会\n不感兴趣，真少见呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d78b4d4275022a259c5a1965f036559ca011f460a775951beed13ca22b152ed4", "ja": "いや、興味がないわけじゃないんだけど……情報を\n集める際の偏りが気になって。著作権の問題も……。", "zh": "不，倒也不是不感兴趣……只是会担心收集\n信息时的偏差。还有著作权的问题也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0ae75cbacd3afd51fa779f30b983571cd46596d09e2c9557a706c67d21db6388", "ja": "まあ、AIの是非はともかくだ。\n全員集まった事だし、公演の話をしよう！", "zh": "不过，先不说AI的是非了。既然大家都到齐了，我们来谈谈公演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a013d9bab82a76b982bd7639975baefbd5293d60e4ded4f9fe3ea815866ce646", "ja": "次の定期公演だけど……\n律子には新曲を歌ってもらおうと思ってる。", "zh": "至于AI究竟好不好先不说了。下次的定期公演……我想请律子唱一首新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "fd507b994ba7755d73c45ce7e8f2360bb8596e8fbd269f0304dc67baa004e4dd", "ja": "はーい、任せてください！\n私なりに、全力でやらせてもらいますから。", "zh": "好——交给我吧！\n我会按照自己的方式，全力以赴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "8c4362617c42336f1ba6c93ed54e92e654bd3fb18009c88e1c7fabf8c121d117", "ja": "律子さん、やる気に満ちていますね～。\nもちろん私たちも、お手伝いさせていただきますよ～。", "zh": "律子小姐真是干劲十足呢～。\n我们当然也会来帮忙的哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "4f92ec8be4e83904ae1b71f9edce61a6a0e741afa8094c3df77fbbf833f66f94", "ja": "ありがとう、朋花！\nみんなのサポート、とっても助かるわ！", "zh": "谢谢你，朋花！\n能有大家的协助，真是帮大忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "df919db5343c092c0fd14c09e853228306d95528efd34309b7bfd2ba88058ab6", "ja": "で、そこでなんですけど……{$P$}！\n今回のレッスンの内容、私が決めてもいいですか？", "zh": "话虽如此……{$P$}！\n这次的练习内容，可以由我来决定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1032_p", "source_sha256": "40250192215b84b7e2c4689e0c95ffd61f79ef160879a4d0b22eb12aab0791a8", "ja": "え、律子が？\n構わないけど……何か理由があるのか？", "zh": "诶，律子来决定？  \n我倒是没意见……不过，你是有什么理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "2c90bc08faf9d2044f671139f605d9da0beaf8b6596119a8cdd74cb05f3e6140", "ja": "ええ。実はレッスンメニューの組み立てに、\nAIを使ってみようかと思って。", "zh": "嗯。其实，我在想要不要试着用AI来制定训练菜单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "d92d087171d599ae972875943cf5a12a2aaf1c73c21e59900cab894fe5db3d74", "ja": "上手くいけば、実用できるんじゃないかと！", "zh": "要是进展顺利，说不定就能实际应用了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1035_p", "source_sha256": "638d8dd91eec28207bf38bbd41d4366a70fced4edcd75eb394c1051965c5234a", "ja": "はは、珍しくやる気だと思ったら、それでか。\nわかったよ。レッスンについては律子に任せる。", "zh": "哈哈，难得看你干劲十足，原来是为了这个啊。\n知道了，训练的事就交给律子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1036_009rit", "source_sha256": "b6320333f1b1f6f583ee11a0eac4ecbfa1a2f0a7c69da20afef89a49e2c120c3", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　そうと決まれば、\nさっそく作業に取りかからないと。", "zh": "谢谢！既然决定了，那就得马上开始工作了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_156_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_156_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "2bcd31b5e5ae4d8d6a17fbb129856ce6b13b802f8f954b830c06d466c6000455", "ja": "もしかしたら今回の公演で、完璧なアイドルの\n秋月律子がお見せできるかもしれませんよ！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "说不定在这次的公演中，能让你见到\n身为完美偶像的秋月律子呢！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
